    "terrainName": "roadblock-street",
    "description": "What: CE-6005 (city battle O-2, docs/designs/group-maneuvers/DESIGN_City_Battle_Showcase.md §11 O-2, docs/DESIGN_Peek_And_Fire.md §9.10) - on the roadblock-street feature terrain (a 3 m wall at x = 100 with one 6 m gate, y 47..53) an idle hostile T-72 ('Enemy Tank') stands IN the gate. While it lives the gate is open to vehicles (the navmesh ignores a live vehicle, P-7a O5). A friendly M1 ('Tank', BasicVehicleSop) 60 m west kills it: its Health owner asks for ONE wreck obstacle (type 8819, car-body, 600 hp) on the hulk's 6.95 x 3.59 m footprint; the bake makes it terrain and the gate is CLOSED to vehicles (1.2 m is left on either side - a man still squeezes past). At 60 s 'Charge Man' walks to (95.4, 50), 1.15 m off the wreck's west face, and sets off his 8 kg demolition charge: the wreck obstacle is removed (CE-6003), the gate opens again. The hulk itself stays (dead bodies never vanish). Judge: see checks.json. Rail: Hrot.ClusterRunner.Integration.Tests WreckBlocksStreetScenarioTests."
  },
